/*.png
jmeter.log
token.txt
qc
query

# Python 虚拟环境与压测过程日志
.venv-token/
perf-logs/

# JMeter 原始结果（体积大，报告 HTML 已入库，需要原始数据可自行生成）
perf/*.jtl
perf/report-*/

deploy/cpolar.log
deploy/cpolar.err.log
# 分机压测的环境变量（含内网 IP 与密码），示例见 deploy/bench.env.example
deploy/bench.env
# 本机压测的环境变量，示例见 deploy/bench.local.env.example
deploy/bench.local.env

# 容量基线：JMeter 原始数据与 HTML 报告不入库，summary.md / results.json / component.md 入库
perf/baseline/results/**/run.jtl
perf/baseline/results/**/report/
perf/baseline/results/**/jmeter.log
perf/baseline/capacity-model.json
# 故障演练原始数据（HTML 报告与 jtl 很大），结论见 docs/stability-drills.md
perf/baseline/results/drill-*.jtl
perf/baseline/results/drill-*.log
perf/baseline/results/drill-*-report/
perf/baseline/results/drill-log.txt
